      "id": "survey-selected-model",
      "subject": "DAMIT 139: selected shape and spin",
      "status": "included",
      "finding": "The official DAMIT metadata export was joined by model and asteroid identity and compared with the selected local recipe shape/model-139.txt. Model 139, version 2011-03-28, pole (223°, 18°), period 4.804043 h match the retained metadata. The archive diameter field is 70 ±7 km; its applicability to our scale is a separate calibration decision. This comparison checks source identity and metadata, not fresh mesh bytes, registration or the completeness of other archives.",
